newton_sqrt(a, tol)  —  3 statements: 0 a phrase, 0 with a phrase in them, 3 code
  The square root of a, to an absolute residual tol.

  1. start from the number itself
    x ← a                                                                       [code]
  repeat until x * x is within tol of a:
    2. average x and a / x
      x ← (x + a / x) / 2.0                                                     [code]
  return x                                                                      [code]
